<title>CROATIA: Croatian September unemployment rises to 18.4 pct. [CORRECTED 09:19 GMT]</title>
<headline>Croatian September unemployment rises to 18.4 pct. [CORRECTED 09:19 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Statistics Bureau (corrects from Ministry of Labour) issued the</p>
<p>following economic indicator details. Previous figures are in</p>
<p>brackets.</p>
<p> CROATIA UNEMPLOYMENT	SEPTEMBER     AUGUST	SEPT '95</p>
<p> Total jobless		  262,203     256,091	240,177</p>
<p> Unemployment rate (pct)     18.4	  18.2	 16.8(17.0)</p>
<p>NOTES -- Total workforce figures are being revised to include private sector but they exclude army, police and farmers. Data exclude unemployed in Serb-held territory. -- Kolumbina Bencevic, Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
